WEBVTT

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.740
Hey.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.730
That NEET from the Sakamakis...

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.120
Loser?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.260
You know, the one who's 
sleeping all the time.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.130
Who is he?

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.220
You mean Shu-san?

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.140
He's the oldest of the Sakamaki brothers. 
His name is Sakamaki Shu-san.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.640
Do you think I'm stupid?

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:09.650
Don't you think I know that already?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.990
You're not very perceptive prey, are you?

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.070
Is there a brain in that head of yours?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.550
I'm asking you what kind of guy he is.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.070
Um...

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:24.580
He doesn't really speak much, and he 
listens to music most of the time... I guess.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.040
Oh, he slept a lot at home too.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.080
Sheesh, he really is a NEET.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.050
Whatever.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.690
Any sign of the awakening?

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.440
Nope, nothing yet.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:03.200
Me, too... Nothing...

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:08.080
We drink her blood all the time.
Is it still not enough?

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.050
I see.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.090
We can't live like this. Let's run.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.890
There they are! Capture them!

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.140
Over here. Don't let them escape!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.850
You're the one who provoked them.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.000
You good-for-nothing aristocrat has-been!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.460
Still giving that insolent look...

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:52.410
We'll brand you so you won't 
get any more stupid ideas.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.850
He granted us an opportunity.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:04.860
At this rate, we won't live 
up to his expectations.

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:34.560
Why are you so shaky on your feet? Anemia?

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:36.610
Yuma-kun...

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.650
Jeez, you're such a pain.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.160
Wh-What?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.000
Shut up and stop squirming around.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.260
Hang on if you don't wanna fall.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.570
Wh-Where are we going?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.500
Who knows?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.780
Prey doesn't need to ask 
questions when being carried.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.500
Shu-san...

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.930
Him again?

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.730
You're in my way. Move!

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.980
Hey, are you listening to me?!

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.940
You again?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:37.080
Um... Good morning, Shu-san.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.460
I noticed you'd left.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:43.030
So you've switched to their side, have you?

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:46.720
A truly immoral woman.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.340
Hey, NEET. Stop blabbing and move!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.270
I was here first.

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.350
Did your brain rot from lack of movement?

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:09.200
You think everything in this 
world was put here for you?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.290
This is why I hate aristocrats.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:20.310
Ah, come to think of it,

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.360
she was once yours, too.

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:25.740
Come here, sow.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.440
Ouch...

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.390
Yuma-kun... Why?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.570
Pain in the ass.

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:05.380
Why... did you suddenly...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.420
Feed on you?

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.380
Why else? I did it to make a point.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:17.400
That not everything goes according to 
the wishes of the bigshot aristocrat.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.100
What are you doing?

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.530
Those clothes... Are you an aristocrat?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:34.420
What are you doing out here?

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:37.530
This is no place for a nobleman like you.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:39.520
Are you lost?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.540
Whatever.

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:49.040
You don't look like a bad person, so here.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.430
It's good. I grew these apples.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.070
Thank you.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.300
I'm Edgar. What's your name?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.430
Edgar... No. It can't be...

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.670
What a surprise.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.910
To think he was still alive...

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:42.840
But he was a human. 
How did he become a vampire?

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:07.380
Ruki-kun.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.370
Ruki-kun?

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.040
What's wrong?

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.850
Can we be Adam?

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:18.900
No. We will become Adam.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:25.340
You're burning up... 
Are you waiting for my fangs?
